<title>USA: Dentsply names president, COO.</title>
<headline>Dentsply names president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dentsply International Inc said Thursday that Gary Kunkle had been named president and chief operating officer effective January 1.  </p>
<p>The company said John Miles, its president and chief executive, was elected vice chairman of the board and will continue to serve as chief executive.</p>
<p>Before joining Dentsply Kunkle spent more than 20 years with Johnson &amp; Johnson and 1994 he served as president of that company's division in Florida, Dentsply said.</p>
</text>
